<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/9932908b693e7115419f3b0b2121d1db684742bb#TestCustomFunctions> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/v0.25/core/text> "class TestCustomFunctions(unittest.TestCase):\n    def setUp(self):\n        self.options = jmespath.Options(custom_functions=CustomFunctions())\n\n    def test_null_to_nonetype(self):\n        data = {\n            'a': {\n                'b': [1, 2, 3]\n            }\n        }\n\n        self.assertEqual(jmespath.search('length0(a.b)', data, self.options), 3)\n        self.assertEqual(jmespath.search('length0(a.c)', data, self.options), 0)" <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/9932908b693e7115419f3b0b2121d1db684742bb> .
